MortalSim
=========

MortalSim is a local web desktop application built around the Mortal
mahjong simulation engine and the libriichi Rust runner.

The application code remains covered by AGPL-3.0-or-later unless a file
states otherwise. Third-party components and model weights may have separate
terms; see THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md and MODEL_LICENSE.md.

MortalSim is an independent project. References to Mortal, NAGA, Rust,
PyTorch, NVIDIA, and mahjong platforms identify compatible technology or
external comparison data and do not imply endorsement or official
affiliation.
